> LCU (Levitation Control unit)

  - Descripción :

    Esta es la placa encargada del control de la levitación del pod.

    [] measurements :

        - master_state_machine : 1 byte (enum)
          [
              Connecting
              Idle
              Levitating
              Current Control
              Debug
              Fault
          ]

        - slave_state_machine : 1 byte (enum)
          [
              SPI Connecting
              Idle
              Levitating
              Current Control
              Debug
              Fault
          ]

        - desired_current  : 4 bytes (float32) -> "A"
        - fixed_vbat       : 4 bytes (float32) -> "V"
        - desired_distance : 4 bytes (float32) -> "mm"
        - lpu_id           : 4 bytes (uint32)

        - fixed_pwm_duty_cycle : 4 bytes (float32) -> "%"
